# Loader
Loader communicates short, indeterminate work. It has an accessible status by default; set `decorative` when a nearby label already communicates loading. Use the quiet `ring` for ordinary product UI, `lines` for compact controls, and `grid` when a branded loader is appropriate. Grid's `pattern` changes only the lighting sequence, not its meaning.
